      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They just need to properly handle the results of whatever they use to get interaction. A trigger that requires locomotion/physical movement should not be stopping the ability to interact with something inside it that only requires key/button inputs.\nYour described issue sounds like this:\n https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/putting-an-oninteract-trigger-inside-a-vrctrigger-volume-makes-it-impossible-to",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
