  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-14T21:18:05.100Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For example if you have a pickup or an object that you can interact with inside a trigger box, you can't pick it up from outside the trigger box. You have to be inside it. The trigger was set to only collide with local player. Not sure if this is a bug but an option to ignore triggers/specific layers for the pickup system would be nice.",
